## Interface: 16001, 120100
## Title: Character Ledger
## Notes: An overview of all your characters (level, gold, rested XP, played time, professions, where you left them), who has which items, who can craft what, and raid and dungeon lockouts, mail waiting at the mailbox, and a log of everything you loot.
